      "body": "\n\n## Overview\n\nExtends the SM103 (B300) GLM-5.2/5.3 low-latency BF16 GEMM table with the TP4 projections, shared expert gate_up and indexer wk; SM103 had TP8 q_b, qkv_a and eh_proj only.\n\n## Claims\n\n- B300, M ≤ 4: 1.11–2.37x over cuBLAS per projection (cold L2).\n\n## Validation\n\n```\npytest tests/kernels/test_bf16_skinny_gemm.py -k \"glm or dsv3\"   → 122 passed, 103 skipped (B300)\nrun_glm52_plan vs F.linear, every routed cell (CUPTI, CUDA graph) → all ≥ 1.05x cold and hot L2\n```\n\n| projection | (N, K) | routed M | M=1 cuBLAS → table (µs, cold L2) | speedup over routed M |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| q_b TP4 / indexer wq_b | (4096, 2048) | 1–3 | 8.83 → 5.76 | 1.11–1.53x |\n| o_proj TP4 | (6144, 4096) | 1 | 15.26 → 11.20 | 1.36x |\n| o_proj TP8 | (6144, 2048) | 1 | 8.06 → 7.26 | 1.11x |\n| indexer wk + weights | (160, 6144) | 1–4 | 5.95 → 2.69 | 1.72–2.37x |\n| shared gate_up TP8 | (512, 6144) | 1–4 | 7.90 → 3.81 | 1.71–2.08x |\n| shared gate_up TP4 | (1024, 6144) | 1–4 | 8.51 → 5.02 | 1.42–1.69x |\n\n## Details\n\nCells kept only if ≥ 5 % faster on cold and hot L2; shared expert down stays on cuBLAS. No e2e (needs 4–8 B300).\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary> Pull Request Checklist </summary>\n\n- [x] Used `/pr-checklist`.\n- [x] AI-assisted.\n\n- [x] **Design Fit:**\n- [x] **Testing and Validation:**\n- [x] **Code Quality and Style:**\n- [x] **Pull Request Contents:**\n</details>\n",
